{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"scowlful-bovine-dragonfly","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"# Prevent a recurrence of the 2026-08-26 /var/gerrit disk-fill (from 5a05)\n\n## Why\nThe acute /var/gerrit disk-fill incident (5a05) was dominated by **one-off investigation\nevidence written to the Gerrit DATA volume**: `/var/gerrit/rebar-quiet-window-evidence/`\nheld two `epoch-probe-20260826T*` dumps (5.2G each = ~11G, 65% of used space), created\nduring the Aug-26 fill window. They were reclaimed (operator-approved 2026-08-30), taking\n/var/gerrit from 37% -> 15%. Nothing prevents this class of debris from recurring, and there\nis no runbook for reclaiming the data volume.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n1. **Investigation/probe output must never land on the Gerrit DATA volume** (`/var/gerrit`).\n   Establish where probe evidence *should* go (root ephemeral scratch or a size-capped\n   temp), and add a guard/policy so a probe writing under `/var/gerrit` is prevented or\n   loudly flagged. Bound probe artifacts at spawn (cf. AGENTS.md bounded-background-process\n   rule) so they self-clean rather than accumulate.\n2. **Add a `/var/gerrit` DATA-disk reclaim/headroom runbook.** `infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md`\n   currently covers ONLY the root volume (`rebar-root-disk-pressure`, docker prunes); the\n   data volume has no reclaim runbook — this GAP was called out during 5a05 remediation.\n3. (Optional/consider) An alarm or check on `/var/gerrit` NON-`site/` subdirectory growth,\n   so debris is caught before it drives the disk-high alarm.\n\n## Notes / scope boundary\nThis is PREVENTION only. The slower data-disk GROWTH driver (tickets-branch enrichment\nfan-out, blob-inclusive store) is a SEPARATE root cause tracked in 4520/536b/0754 — do not\nduplicate that here.","id":"3e92-b7f4-dede-4c17","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":["ops","disk-pressure","gerrit-box","prevention"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Prevent investigation evidence on /var/gerrit + add data-disk reclaim runbook"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788108027944241757,"uuid":"e6ad2ee1-7a91-4107-ade1-c15d27f97916"}